&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/antoinebou12/uml-mcp"&gt;uml-mcp&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; gives an MCP client real diagram tools: an assistant supplies Mermaid, PlantUML, or another supported diagram source, and the server returns rendered output and useful links. The current repository documents five tools and a catalog of roughly 37 Kroki-backed types. Those counts describe the documented interface, not a rendering benchmark. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://antoineboucher.info/CV/blog/posts/uml-mcp/"&gt;Version française&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
